{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b0e6187bca0b76e2e4986337af8f8f529677c3c799a8bd6ba016115f09625389", "ja": "朋花、着替え終わったみたいだな。\n新しい衣装の着心地はどうだ？", "zh": "朋花好像换好衣服了。\n新衣服穿着感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "ca2394826d532b555e2f84dc653feaba2b2f8ca7125cbc06e5f1472a6604c82a", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nええ、ちょうど良いサイズで、問題ありませんよ～。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n嗯，尺寸正合适，没问题哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "64a19e6f3e9ea8592beff7f4a58734c92d787bf5a29745eee8749f4836884309", "ja": "すこし水着のように感じるのは、\n野外ステージ向けだからでしょうか～？", "zh": "之所以感觉有点像泳装，是因为这是面向户外舞台的设计吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1003_p", "source_sha256": "052e9f6905ece166383ae59cc248de1c577c1130ef5f99ee2aee2f5c01d17dd0", "ja": "実はそうなんだ。本番の演出で、色々やってみたい事が\nあって……だから、濡れてもすぐ乾く素材になってる。", "zh": "其实是这样的。因为正式演出的效果，我有许多想尝试的\n点子……所以才采用了就算弄湿也能立刻干透的材质。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "aa89ac9a4c363b40a008cf746ede67459aa8eb48036200f6fd441d4ec10ecfd8", "ja": "そうですか～。ちなみに{$P$}さんは\nどんな演出を考えているんですか～？", "zh": "这样啊～。顺便问一下，{$P$}先生在演出方面有什么想法呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c31508d2daba7a1bd7c80cd6c59e15f70ab0fef2e5a889b31c49ba4ce52670e1", "ja": "ああ。せっかくだから、夏らしい感じで……\n泡を使った演出にしたいと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "啊。难得有这个机会，我想做得有点夏日气息……打算用泡泡来设计演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "a226d3163eec9b2e2e5bd670f03b537501c10e09f87810c53dc8afb53008b2da", "ja": "泡を使った演出……なるほど、たしかに\n涼しそうでいいかもしれませんね～？", "zh": "用泡沫来进行演出……原来如此，确实看起来很清凉，或许挺不错的呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6090d4bcddc2da7d024bae26f83c9eb76d2d0f871d09cc9075708590a7aed49d", "ja": "お客さんたちはもちろん、朋花たちも一緒に\n楽しめるものを考えているから、よろしく頼むな！", "zh": "当然是在考虑让观众们，还有朋花你们也能一起享受的内容，拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "c3447259d9bbdea3411bd47416141df2972cc44e17c6ac736cf1011300f63790", "ja": "子豚ちゃんたちと一緒に楽しめるライブですか～。\n今から待ち遠しいですね～♪", "zh": "能和小猪仔们一起尽情享受的演唱会吗～。\n现在就开始让人期待起来了呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0cd50081d2f9d30125668a47034f819e1c21108c0a20c7d44e31b9863ef257db", "ja": "そうだな。客席の隅々まで、\n朋花の愛を届けてあげてくれ！", "zh": "没错。要把朋花的爱传递到观众席的每个角落！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "9b3a3aef2f195918a7ffe856f705a346ae708ea26995ced9917a622bb260cf4c", "ja": "あら……{$P$}さん～？\n私を、誰だと思っているのですか～？", "zh": "哎呀……{$P$}先生～？\n你以为我是谁呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "df32c328ff2161823335436bb722b4341c07f344d28ee30943db20ccd1072673", "ja": "そもそも、聖母の姿を見て、\nよろこばない子豚ちゃんはいませんからね～。", "zh": "说到底，看到圣母的身姿，就没有小猪仔会不高兴的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "bb24cc18b5d09caf0e81ecdad258bc88511dfbcf794303d848c96d55f190f59f", "ja": "ですから、それ以上に……どれくらい\n楽しませることができるか、腕の見せどころですよ～？", "zh": "所以说，接下来就要看我的本事了……究竟能让大家开心到什么程度呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1013_p", "source_sha256": "429dd4360d29edda4787b94eff43a03abfdd8427c557679e6440176eadaad7c6", "ja": "うん、そうだな。朋花の子豚ちゃん達の\n期待に応えられるよう、頑張るよ。", "zh": "嗯，说得对。为了不辜负朋花的小猪人偶们的\n期待，我会加油的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "011d770e73e827548e916d8589ce42ad73d41919b2e9de8738389b1a900b4205", "ja": "うふふ。それでこそ、{$P$}さんに\n仕事を任せた甲斐があるというものです～。", "zh": "呵呵，这才不枉我把工作交给{$P$}先生呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1015_p", "source_sha256": "db1c60e4cba30225d31f341b727a2fe60a60a555e9c51cdd1c7cfc704b029caf", "ja": "（朋花の雰囲気がいつもより楽しそうというか、\n少しはしゃいでいるように見えるな……）", "zh": "（总觉得朋花的状态比平时更开心，或者说，看起来好像有点兴奋……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1016_p", "source_sha256": "333bd701e50f652d3912bb73722379bb076d4aa3ab3b5202b6a9a1c4599df940", "ja": "（それくらい、ファンの人達と楽しめるライブが\n楽しみなのかもしれない。よし、俺も……）", "zh": "（她或许就是这么期待能和粉丝们一起享受的演唱会吧。好，我也……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "e3e1102f0ff7c53fec580eda3b0394977a5c9e3f956db19e21af6c59f5a934b5", "ja": "……ふ～っ……。", "zh": "……呼～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fd653dadca5b8f7fa22a5dcac706099095c1e680d04a4b1d07b8c8541e843d4c", "ja": "う、うわっ！？\n……な、なんだ？　どうかしたのか、朋花！", "zh": "呜、呜哇！？\n……怎、怎么了？朋花，你没事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "d0f74009956d6c5392212fe19da9f60959a3fa142486fd7fe3591818c1503ee2", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、\nボーッと考えごとをしているからですよ～？", "zh": "是因为{$P$}先生\n一直在发呆想事情呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "6d7e9a977f52d2eabf91bad0d5dcbbb47332dc407278ba432febbb9236015a13", "ja": "私も、そろそろ着替えたいので……\n用がないなら、いったん外に出てもらえますか～？", "zh": "我也差不多该换衣服了……\n如果没什么事的话，可以先出去一下吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5fcfe2a6c1f95b8d267971f7a7d776e8aebb55b2b45c33edd56c8e76a8ae0999", "ja": "そ、そうだったな、ごめん。\n……けど、朋花がこんな悪戯するなんて珍しいな……。", "zh": "对、对哦，抱歉。\n……不过，朋花居然会恶作剧，还真是少见啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "9e05ad1e71e204c719aa65d7f137a5f8dfe7bd5657d6ea326f3bee90d2a0a530", "ja": "そうでしょうか～？　けど、聖母にスキを見せた\n{$P$}さんが悪いんですよ～。", "zh": "是这样吗～？不过，让圣母找到破绽的{$P$}先生才不好哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0164_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "07c14fce5c4cdd5fbfcc0356bd9475bc234c11fbd212180d67dd69840f91d805", "ja": "ライブの準備、しっかり頑張ってくださいね～。\nうふふっ。", "zh": "请好好加油准备演唱会哦～  \n呜呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
